 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Manage Documents (22P)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">During the product engineering phase, new products are designed and developed. You design new products or product lines to take advantage of current process technology and to improve quality and reliability. Alternately, you change an existing product due to changing market or customer requirements. The result of this product phase is drawings and specifications that must be maintained through the documents created in the Document Management System. This scope item allows for creation of a Document Info Record (DIR), and the addition and maintenance of metadata and attachments to the DIR.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Search and display Document Info Records (DIR)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create DIR</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add and edit metadata to the DIR</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload and download attachments</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Search and maintain Document Info Records with the new Manage Documents SAP Fiori app</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload and download attachments without active plug-ins</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage versions of the document effectively</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Share additional information simply and effectively by adding URLs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Documents can be classified</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>管理文档 (22P)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在产品工程阶段，将设计和开发新产品。您可以设计新产品或产品线，以利用当前流程技术并提高质量和可靠性。或者，由于市场或客户需求发生变化，更改现有产品。此产品阶段的结果是图纸和规格，必须通过文档管理系统中创建的文档进行维护。此范围项目允许创建文档信息记录 (DIR)，以及向 DIR 添加和维护元数据和附件。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">搜索并显示文档信息记录 (DIR)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建 DIR</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加和编辑元数据到 DIR</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">上载和下载附件</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9aa16081aaf4d0aba4af68ee629d8da__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用新的管理文档 SAP Fiori 应用搜索和维护文档信息记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">无需活动插件即可上载和下载附件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">有效管理文档版本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过添加 URL 简单有效地共享附加信息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">可对凭证进行分类</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
